WEBVTT

00:00:00.883 --> 00:00:01.838
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s <b>this</b>?

00:00:03.963 --> 00:00:04.750
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s a key.

00:00:06.852 --> 00:00:07.961
<v><b>A:</b></v> What are <b>these</b>?

00:00:10.084 --> 00:00:11.128
<v><b>B:</b></v> They’re keys.

00:00:13.229 --> 00:00:14.246
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s <b>that</b>?

00:00:16.364 --> 00:00:17.349
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s a cat.

00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:20.541
<v><b>A:</b></v> What are <b>those</b>?

00:00:22.641 --> 00:00:23.765
<v><b>B:</b></v> They’re cats.